THOUGHT: Let me also fix the SetEncoder in the CER encoder to ensure it uses definite length encoding:

```bash
sed -i '/class SetEncoder(encoder.SequenceEncoder):/,/class SequenceEncoder(encoder.SequenceEncoder):/{
    /class SetEncoder(encoder.SequenceEncoder):/,/return substrate/{
        /def encodeValue/,/return substrate/{
            s/def encodeValue(self, value, asn1Spec, encodeFun, \*\*options):/def encodeValue(self, value, asn1Spec, encodeFun, **options):\n        # CER requires definite length encoding for SET\n        options = options.copy()\n        options['\''defMode'\''] = True/
        }
    }
}' pyasn1/codec/cer/encoder.py
```

